worker_module_budget
  module "formal_ai_worker_00.js"
  ceiling 1299
  rationale "Part of the mechanically split browser mirror of the Rust solver: issue #658 divided one oversized worker file by line count, so this shard has no subject of its own. Its ceiling falls as its logic moves into js/wasm-worker. Ceiling moved 1297 to 1299 for the timezone-places seed cache this shard declares and invalidates while shard 09 reads it (entity-grounded hours batch); a duplicated reset line was removed."
